  - parameter: Control matching tolerance 0.1 dex (0.1 R/Re for radius); normal SFR defined as -0.5 < Delta Sigma_SFR < 0.5 [2 Data: "relative to a set of control spaxels with normal SFRs ($-0.5 <$ $\Delta \Sigma_{\rm SFR}$ $<0.5$)"]
